# Skills are text and are compared byte-for-byte by tooling on both sides of a
# checkout. Without this, a Windows clone rewrites every file to CRLF and any
# guard that compares content reports identical files as different — which has
# already happened here twice, once to check-plugin-sync and once to the
# frontmatter parser in scripts/validate.mjs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
